-Congressman, have you spoken

00:09:49.701 --> 00:09:50.934
to Speaker McCarthy?
-Are you planning to resign?

00:09:50.934 --> 00:09:53.067
-Congressman, what
about committee assignments?

00:09:53.067 --> 00:09:54.968
-Excuse me.
Excuse me, please.

00:09:54.968 --> 00:09:55.834
-Do you think you're qualified
-Excuse me.

00:09:55.834 --> 00:09:57.234
-to serve in Congress?

00:09:57.234 --> 00:09:58.667
[ Camera shutter clicking ]
Are you going to give

00:09:58.667 --> 00:10:00.300
