00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:02.000
-[ Indistinct ]
-Guys, we're going to need
a little bit --

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:03.334
need a little space here.
-How can you possibly do your

00:10:03.334 --> 00:10:05.133
work with this entire ordeal
-New York Republicans

00:10:05.133 --> 00:10:06.334
