-are calling you a disgrace.

00:10:06.334 --> 00:10:07.767
You will not resign?
-What is your response?

00:10:07.767 --> 00:10:09.033
-Pardon me.
-What is your response
-Excuse me, guys.

00:10:09.033 --> 00:10:10.067
