-The congressman is trying

00:10:10.067 --> 00:10:11.667
to get in the elevator.
Excuse us.

00:10:11.667 --> 00:10:14.501
-Man, what would this guy do
without elevators?

00:10:14.501 --> 00:10:15.534
[ Laughter ]

00:10:15.534 --> 00:10:16.767
He's going to have to live
in one.

00:10:16.767 --> 00:10:18.434
When he gets in,
he probably just presses

00:10:18.434 --> 00:10:20.300
