[ Laughter ]

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:22.067
[ As Santos ] I have offices
on all the floors.

00:10:22.067 --> 00:10:23.200
"Shut the [bleep] up, George!"

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:25.968
[ Laughter ]

00:10:28.534 --> 00:10:29.968
Also, check out this move

00:10:29.968 --> 00:10:32.000
