to a member of Congress.

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:46.534
And remember, he's an athlete!

00:10:46.534 --> 00:10:50.267
[ Laughter ]

00:10:50.267 --> 00:10:51.868
-This is what happens
when you're a party of Trump.

00:10:51.868 --> 00:10:53.868
You attract con artists
like George Santos.

00:10:53.868 --> 00:10:55.434
They've tanked
